  "interpretation": "The robust refit changes the MAP satellite for 20 of 344 retained tracks (5.81%; 5.53% by occupied seconds). Most tracks retain the same MAP and have nearly identical mass, but shortlist membership is less stable: only 58.72% have the same unordered top three. This establishes a real association-model inconsistency for a minority of calibration tracks, especially c559, but does not quantify its effect on reception direction coefficients because the required component directions were not frozen."
